4.5 Synthetic Data Evaluation
As mentioned earlier in Section 2, the phishing emails are gathered in two ways. One group is real phishing emails from diﬀerent existing data sources, and the other group is computer generated based on a manually constructed grammar. Comparing the performance of the diﬀerent systems on synthesized emails can give us an estimate of the similarity between these type of emails.
